nically. Value Book, settled revenue and honest buyer satisfaction. Compare sale proceeds after warranty risk with retained inventory Book credit, storage and spoilage. Do not force below-cost liquidation solely because the round is ending. Never relax the buyer's quality, expiry or signature requirements to create volume."}}
