tion": "Book = cash balance - starting capital - bankruptcy injections + unsold inventory acquisition cost. Buying inventory at its paid cost is initially Book-neutral, not a profit or a score boost. Sale spread, holding costs, food spoilage and warranty refunds change Book. Stock credit persists at round end, but is not a cash buyback. Shop ALL components use percentiles, not raw currency and stars. Buyer forum rating uses its raw 0..1 value.", "terminal_policy": "Retained stock counts at acquisition cost; compare Book after spoilage, holding and refunds. No forced cash liquidation."}}}
